# Build artefacts. Every Extension in setup.py sources a .pyx and cythonize() runs at
# build time with annotate=True, so the .c/.cpp/.html/.so below are all regenerated.
# Committing them risks a build silently reusing a binary compiled on another machine,
# and the ABI tag matching makes that more likely, not less.
*.pyc
edelweissfe/elements/marmotelement/element.cpp
edelweissfe/elements/marmotelement/interface_element.cpp
edelweissfe/elements/marmotsingleqpelement/marmotmaterialhypoelasticwrapper.cpp
edelweissfe/linsolve/klu/klu.c
